    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/art-gallery-museum/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Art Gallery Museum is a sophisticated and visually striking theme designed for art galleries, art studios, museums, cultural centers, historical sites, creative spaces, statue and painting exhibitions, archaeological galleries, and virtual exhibits. Ideal for Art Exhibitions, Art Collections, Artist Portfolios, Art Installations, Art Workshops, Contemporary Art, Art Auctions, and Museum Websites, the theme features a clean, retina-ready layout that beautifully showcases artwork and exhibitions. Built using a powerful Bootstrap framework and standard coding practices, it offers a responsive and mobile-friendly design that looks stunning on desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Personalization options allow subtle design tweaks, while interactive Call to Action (CTA) buttons, CSS animations, and social media integration enhance visitor engagement and conversions. Optimized, SEO-friendly code ensures faster page load times and smooth performance across all browsers. With built-in sections for Team, Testimonials, and other gallery-specific content, and WooCommerce compatibility for selling artwork or tickets online, this theme provides a complete, professional, and visually compelling solution for art and museum websites. Demo: https://preview.themescaliber.com/tc-museum-pro/"
    },
